WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.320
Her sister chooses every word with care.

2
00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:07.160
Mrs Mallard has heart
trouble, and the news is bad.

3
00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:11.550
Her husband, Brently, has been
killed in a railroad disaster.

4
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.030
She weeps in her sister's arms.

5
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.660
Then she climbs the stairs alone.

6
00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.140
The door closes.

7
00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:20.060
One hour begins.

8
00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:23.470
Upstairs, an armchair
faces an open window.

9
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:27.700
So, alone in that room,
what does she really feel?

10
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.880
In this mission, you'll follow
the story's first moves:

11
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.720
the news, the tears, the room.

12
00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:38.760
You'll look out of that open window, at
trees "aquiver with the new spring life".

13
00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:42.100
And you'll see how the narrator
takes us inside her head,

14
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:44.450
where no other character can follow.

15
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.230
Your mission: work out what she feels.
